<http://www.example.org/meddevice> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "OWL-DL ontology modelling the EUDAMED registry: medical devices, manufacturers, identified risks, reported incidents and field safety corrective actions (FSCAs)." .
<http://www.example.org/meddevice> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<http://www.example.org/meddevice> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-04-27"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<http://www.example.org/meddevice> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> "Universitat Oberta de Catalunya" .
<http://www.example.org/meddevice> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "EUDAMED Medical Device Ontology" .
<http://www.example.org/meddevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ontology for the European catalogue of high-risk medical devices and in vitro diagnostic devices, under MDR (EU 2017/745) and IVDR (EU 2017/746) regulatory frameworks." .
<http://www.example.org/meddevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "European Medical Device Catalogue Ontology" .
