<http://www.example.org/meddevice#hasClassification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Assigns a regulatory risk class to a device." .
<http://www.example.org/meddevice#hasClassification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has classification" .
# 
# http://www.example.org/meddevice#hasRisk
<http://www.example.org/meddevice#hasRisk> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.example.org/meddevice#hasRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.example.org/meddevice#Device> .
<http://www.example.org/meddevice#hasRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.example.org/meddevice#Risk> .
<http://www.example.org/meddevice#hasRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Associates a device with an identified risk." .
<http://www.example.org/meddevice#hasRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has risk" .
# 
# http://www.example.org/meddevice#involvesRisk
<http://www.example.org/meddevice#involvesRisk> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.example.org/meddevice#involvesRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.example.org/meddevice#Incident> .
<http://www.example.org/meddevice#involvesRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.example.org/meddevice#Risk> .
<http://www.example.org/meddevice#involvesRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Associates an incident with the risk category it materialised." .
<http://www.example.org/meddevice#involvesRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "involves risk" .
# 
# http://www.example.org/meddevice#isAssociatedWithIncident
<http://www.example.org/meddevice#isAssociatedWithIncident> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
